  "title": "Mozzarella-Stuffed Chicken Meatballs",
  "description": "These chicken meatballs have a gooey mozzarella center — delicious in a sub sandwich or served in tomato sauce with pasta for a family-pleasing meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Jen619"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T01:28:32-04:00",
